      "name": "Market trader",
      "role": "merchant",
      "x": -4,
      "z": -2.2,
      "facing": 0,
      "greeting": "Bread from the Heartlands, herbs from the glade, potions from a cousin who knows what she's doing."
    },
    {
      "name": "Scribe",
      "role": "villager",
      "archetype": "mage",
      "x": -24,
      "z": 21.5,
      "facing": 0,
      "wander": 3,
      "lines": [
        "Thaloria copies everything. The originals stay in the Citadel; the copies go out into the world.",
        "The Forbidden Archive? Every scribe has a theory. Mine is that it's full of very dull tax ledgers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Student",
      "role": "villager",
      "archetype": "civilian",
      "x": 4,
      "z": 10,
      "facing": 3.1,
      "wander": 6,
      "lines": [
        "Three years of runes and I can read one door-sign. My master says that's fast.",
        "They say only one scholar holds the Archive's key. No one else has ever seen past the iron door."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Watchman",
      "role": "guard",
      "x": 2.6,
      "z": -56,
      "facing": 3.1416,
      "lines": [
        "The Lower Town grew outside the walls when the city ran out of room. Mind your purse after dark."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lamplighter",
      "role": "villager",
      "archetype": "peasant",
      "x": -3,
      "z": 30,
      "facing": 1.6,
      "wander": 8,
      "lines": [
        "Up at dusk, down at dawn. The Citadel windows light themselves \u2014 I do the rest."
      ]
